  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1360060648353267712/1658182205/1500x500\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1125\" height=\"375\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/b2JRqGu8sD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/758105691633352706?color=ae9263&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=655231\" width=\"222\" height=\"32\"></strong></a>&nbsp;᠎<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sRpVyKr.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"31\"></a><span style=\"font-size:24px\">᠎&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tibHzIE.png\" width=\"112\" height=\"31\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>🐌 環境增添 🦀</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組為你的世界增添了<strong>環境</strong>生物，並提供了捕捉牠們的工具。模組中包含多種全動畫動物，從可愛的柯基犬到放射狀對稱的海星、害羞的螃蟹和迷你犰狳。目標是在你的世界中引入更多動物，以滿足玩家建造動物園和捕捉生物的興趣！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3bCz7Sl.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"41\"></span></p><blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">🐾&nbsp;<strong>動物清單！</strong></span></p>\n</blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以下部分詳細介紹了模組新增的所有動物，以及關於生成、繁殖、馴服和特殊功能等資訊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">- 持續開發中 -</span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">🐕 <strong>哺乳動物：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>潘布魯克/卡迪根柯基犬</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>白果蝠</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>九帶犰狳</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>粉紅仙犰狳</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>裸鼴鼠</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鬚檉柳猴</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鼴鼠</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>指猴</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>環尾狐猴</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>合趾猿</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>松貂</strong><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紅河豬<br>懶熊</strong><br></span></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>🐦 鳥類：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>猩紅蜜鳥</strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">🐍 <strong>爬行動物與兩棲動物：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>高冠變色龍</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>匹諾曹變色龍</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蛛尾擬角蝰</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>枯葉龜</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鈍頭樹蛇</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>葉蛙</strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>🐠 魚類：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>長角牛魚</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>拿破崙隆頭魚</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>藍點魟</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>藍點魟</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>月魚</strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<strong>🐌</strong>&nbsp;<strong>陸生無脊椎動物：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鍬形蟲</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>橡膠鴨鼠婦</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>巨型陸蝸牛<br>薄餅海蛞蝓<br></strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;🦐&nbsp;<strong>水生無脊椎動物：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>雪人蟹</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>羞恥蟹</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>小丑蝦</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>兔螺</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>巧克力海星</strong></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:8px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LnKJOFl.png\" width=\"1328\" height=\"48\"></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>🎯 捕捉生物：吹箭、飛鏢與板條箱！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為了幫助你收集和運輸動物，模組中的許多動物可以放入<strong>水桶、花盆、瓶子或碗</strong>中。除此之外，我們還新增了一系列工具，用於麻醉和裝箱任何動物，特別是不易用其他方式捕捉的。&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JAIkpxk.png\" width=\"1123\" height=\"200\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>板條箱</strong>是一種新的動物運輸工具。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">空板條箱可用於<em>麻醉</em>的實體上，<em>右鍵點擊</em>即可捕捉。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">再次<em>右鍵點擊</em>即可從板條箱中釋放實體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">裝有生物的板條箱會獲得新的紋理和附魔光效，並在提示資訊中顯示所含生物的名稱。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>吹箭與飛鏢</strong>可讓你麻醉生物以便捕捉。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">吹箭是一種使用飛鏢作為彈藥的遠程武器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與拉弓類似，可蓄力後射出一枚飛鏢。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">飛鏢會對生物造成一層「眩暈」效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">達到一定眩暈次數後，生物會進入為期<em>30秒</em>的麻醉狀態，並顯示睡眠粒子效果。</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">麻醉所需的眩暈次數取決於生物的生命值：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2.5 顆心 = 1 次眩暈</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5 顆心 = 2 次眩暈</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">10 顆心 = 3 次眩暈</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">25 顆心 = 4 次眩暈</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">25 顆心以上 = 5 次眩暈</span></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rz6zyy3.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"41\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>致謝</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#036\"><a style=\"color:#036\" href=\"https://twitter.com/Ninnih_\" rel=\"nofollow\">NinniH</a> </span>：素材、程式碼與音效</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#036\"><a style=\"color:#036\" href=\"https://twitter.com/omaypaty\" rel=\"nofollow\">OmayPaty</a></span>：素材</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#036\"><a style=\"color:#036\" href=\"https://twitter.com/_Graus\" rel=\"nofollow\">GRAUS</a></span>：素材</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#036\"><a style=\"color:#036\" href=\"https://discord.gg/b2JRqGu8sD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span>magmastrider</span><span>#3837</span></strong></a><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span>（來自我們的 Discord 頻道）</span></span><span style=\"color:#036\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span>：截圖</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span><span style=\"color:#036\"><a style=\"color:#036\" href=\"https://discord.gg/b2JRqGu8sD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span>fool#1369</span></strong></a></span>&nbsp;（來自我們的 Discord 頻道）&nbsp;：截圖</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&amp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><strong>&nbsp;特別感謝 BisectHosting 對我們的贊助！</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n3uFyrw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
